## 8. Validation Strategy

### Leave-one-generator-out cross-validation

- 10 generators → 10 folds
- Each fold: train on 9 generators, validate on 1
- Tests generalization to unseen synthesis methods

### Fold assignment (alphabetical)

```
fold 0: hold out diffgan_tts
fold 1: hold out elevenlabs
fold 2: hold out grad_tts
fold 3: hold out openvoicev2     ← 25,000 files (5× others due to accents)
fold 4: hold out playht
fold 5: hold out pro_diff
fold 6: hold out unit_speech
fold 7: hold out wavegrad2
fold 8: hold out xtts_v2
fold 9: hold out your_tts
```

Real speech distributed evenly across folds (~2,447 each), random with seed=42.

### Manifest CSV columns

```
path, label, generator, speaker, sentence_id, accent_style, source_format, group_id, fold
```

Note: `orig_sr` column was NOT included (omitted to keep things simple — sample rate can be recovered from generator identity or by reading the file).

