## 14. Research Papers

### 1. DiffSSD (Purdue, 2024)
- Dataset with 70k synthetic + 24k real clips from 10 generators
- **This IS our training data** (DiffSSD = `generated_speech/` folder)
- Wav2Vec2 achieved 3% EER, PaSST 3.5% when retrained on it

### 2. ASVspoof 5 (2024)
- Large benchmark: 32 attack algorithms, ~2000 speakers, codec/compression
- Architecture pattern: pretrained frontend → trainable backend → scoring

### 3. RFP — Residual Fingerprint (Pizarro et al., 2024)
- "Lightweight Model Attribution and Detection of Synthetic Speech via Audio Residual Fingerprints"
- Training-free: STFT → spectral energy → FIR filter → residual → per-generator fingerprint → Mahalanobis distance
- 99%+ AUROC on clean data; fragile under MP3/reverb/noise
- **Implemented as Tier 0** with strong validation results

